Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.11,1:29:27.67,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好想掩起耳朵　不去聽那週末的嘈雜
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.67,1:29:30.93,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}踐踏著無處傾瀉的寂寞
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.93,1:29:34.44,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}摧毀一樣東西　通常須要勇氣
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.44,1:29:38.14,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}倒塌的一瞬間　卻是如此短暫
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.14,1:29:44.12,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哎～因為兩人總是在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.68,1:29:50.66,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}突然之间少了一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.66,1:29:58.95,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}隨著強風吹動　飄流的雲帶來了早晨
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.95,1:30:05.82,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}此刻雖然兩相分離　但若還來的及是否能重新來過
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.95,1:30:13.18,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}與其希望被愛　更期盼能以透明的心情去愛你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.18,1:30:22.48,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就像是站在在雨過天晴後的大地上一般
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.14,1:30:33.89,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}心靈乾涸的日子和迷戀你的日子 都在我身上纏繞著
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.89,1:30:37.46,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在鑲上了白邊的嚴冬日子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.46,1:30:41.21,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}因為曾經有你在全部都成為了我的回憶
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.21,1:30:53.67,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哎～我只想哭 现在只要放声大哭一场
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.67,1:31:02.20,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}是否能重新拉回　你那顆被強風帶走的心
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.20,1:31:09.01,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就如同夏日來臨　寒徹骨的冰雪終將溶盡
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.01,1:31:16.01,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}平凡無奇的每一天　驀然回首中竟也充滿著光輝
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.01,1:31:25.27,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}有如放學的鐘聲　此刻依然迴響不已
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.27,1:31:49.28,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}當季節逝去時　你已不在這裡
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.59,1:32:05.93,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}隨著強風吹動　飄流的雲帶來了早晨
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.93,1:32:12.72,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}此刻雖然兩相分離　但若還來的及是否能重新來過
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.91,1:32:20.06,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}與其希望被愛　更期盼能以透明的心情去愛你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.16,1:32:29.19,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就像是站在在雨過天晴後的大地上一般
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你開的太過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的駕駛技術怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 前面有隕石群
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要撞到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:08.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 還以為你要不行了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得不錯嘛 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 一口氣衝過去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這樣下去會完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快180度旋轉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆哆哆 哆啦A夢 控制桿不聼使喚...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:01:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 GAME OVER了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香也被打敗了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣 我跟小夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去終點了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在背後搞偷襲 太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣也好 贏了就行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣 再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個遊戲有點太難了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就說過很難的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底 都是因為你經常跟小夫爭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 他那麼的自滿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 是爸爸買給我的生日禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羨慕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不去一兩次宇宙旅行 會被人笑老套的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從大宇宙看上去 地球就跟豆子一樣小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 從宇宙那裡看地球 非常的美麗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以拜託爸爸準備你們的份哦 怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(71.339,470)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有大雄的份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有言在先 去的話要接受訓練的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又遲鈍又沒運動神經的沒用鬼大雄 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 沒我這麼有體力跟勇敢的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 什麼時候出發
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天嗎 後天嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能這麼快就能去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要等到21世紀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 我馬上就去拜託哆啦A夢帶我去宇宙旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拜託爸爸準備大雄的份吧 好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才拿出這個遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不到一會兒就完蛋了 真無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 很快就到終點了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我不會輸給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 操控失靈 怎麼回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小 小夫 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輸了應該會被退出外面的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難 難道我們被困在遊戲裡面了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害 是有生命的樹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這麼多天然的泥土
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於找到了 我們居住的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去調查一下這個星球的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『室內宇宙飛船』
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以在室內體驗宇宙船內的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好有趣的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,設置到地球跟月亮之間的距離 好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒重力了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就會習慣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫 幫幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經習慣了 好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都分不清上下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為沒有重力 所以沒有上下的分別
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 出去外面看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在這房間裡面相當於宇宙船 打開窗戶的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會跟空氣一起被吸去外面的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣子啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我們喝剩的汽水嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像肥皂泡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 不要這樣子啦 會沾到衣服的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡放屁的話 會像火箭一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你們靜點玩好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底在做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 吃西瓜...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽的聲音...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家裡全成了宇宙船的狀態了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 誰幫幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:45.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得趕快停止才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總是搞這些惡作劇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快給我收拾乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順便整理好不要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 漫畫、模型空盒子滿地都是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總算收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像大掃除似的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 胖虎他們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 還在遊戲裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 那個『星球撞擊遊戲』在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道去了哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 知不知道畫著宇宙圖畫的 這麼大的盒子在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個模型盒子嗎 跟垃圾一起扔掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去找...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 你們收拾好房間了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找清楚看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的確扔在那裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去找一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩人明明還沒收拾好房間啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫怎樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲結束後應該會出來的說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們果然還沒回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪 應該早就到終點 或是game over了的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是遊戲出了故障 被困在遊戲裡面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那遊戲在垃圾站不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到可能太遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:12:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『歷史照相機』
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這時候照相有什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個照相機可以追溯之前的時間攝像的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如設置到四小時前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄放屁的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後是窗破了 遊戲吹到了外面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 媽媽收拾東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是媽媽啊 拿著那遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去垃圾站
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以照到拿走遊戲的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲還在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的光搬走了遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛向這個方向了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那邊的拐角了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從這裡拐彎了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學校的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像去了學校的後面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是後山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是去了後山
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你們『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了山腳的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:52.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的確是在這附近消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UFO？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎跟小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被UFO掠走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我破壞自己贖罪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我們快去追吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『竹蜻蜓』不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不知道那是哪個星球的UFO
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快點拿火箭出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的倒簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙是很廣闊的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀河系裡像地球一樣星球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這大宇宙裡就有一億萬倍那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個一個找的話 一生也找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:03.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是石頭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像星星的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是地球的石頭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大發現
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這應該是UFO的駕駛員丟失的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這個的話就有辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『宇宙救命艇』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,設定好這塊石頭的探索裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能在宇宙中追尋這塊石頭的來歷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 馬上出發
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是宇宙是非常危險的地方 沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這當然知道 但是不能放著他們不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 馬上出發
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快要達到瞬間跳躍極限 快要達到瞬間跳躍極限
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬間跳躍結束 瞬間跳躍結束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離子風暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得 得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.53,0:18:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡不是大雄的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是哪兒的工廠倉庫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡有扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像從外面上鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 紋絲不動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像科幻電影一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還在遊戲裡面...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都還在瞬間跳躍的空間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪兒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像去了漫無邊際的遙遠宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像從瞬間跳躍裡出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說接近那塊石頭的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發 發生什麼事了 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是進入離子風暴裡面了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片上看到過的UFO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說胖虎跟小夫就在那裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎被擊中了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎 怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去用『時光布』修理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『宇宙霜-噴霧型』
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噴上這個 就等於有穿上宇宙服的狀態了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空氣排出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算打開門也不用擔心會被吸出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可真慘...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『時光布』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『時光布』...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捨棄『救命艇』  快脫出吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們過去UFO那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是在玩『室內宇宙飛船』那樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 這裡是真正的宇宙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種地方 虧你還能放出屁來...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點進去裡面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡好像是倉庫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會有人在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心點 因為不知道是什麼樣的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這聲音是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(180.33,470)\fs24}我知心的朋友 太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(675.743,470)\fs24}太好了 你們都沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.79,0:22:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 這裡到底是哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 都是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.49,0:22:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 被UFO掠走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼這裡是真正的宇宙？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 竟然會弄錯路線
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬間跳躍之後就是這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:23:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 不走出這裡的話就無法航行了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輔助回路 最大出力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啟航
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源開到最大了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一點而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.87,0:23:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像衝出離子風暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.62,0:23:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼多破爛兒 要運到哪裏去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 首先試著交涉看看能不能讓我們回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 這個UFO的宇宙人是怎樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.81,0:24:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會發光  還很小的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發光？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是螢火星人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定 真面目是這樣的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 不要這樣子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.10,0:24:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是狐狸星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼都好 應該能好好跟他們商量的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.64,0:24:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.39,0:24:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒人在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會真的是 很可怕的外星人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.03,0:24:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼也...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你打了我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.83,0:24:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜 冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.24,0:24:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我們是 説來話長...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.74,0:24:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是宇宙少年騎士團
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們來我們的宇宙船裡 想做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:57.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是想做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 是你們擅自帶我們來的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們才沒有帶人上來
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.11,0:25:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們隨便上來 我要逮捕你們
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.51,0:25:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎 抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.78,0:25:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會讓你們得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是別反抗比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.61,0:25:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開門 放我們出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.17,0:25:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就狠狠揍你們一頓
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.93,0:25:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好談的話 我想他們應該會理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.55,0:25:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被沒收了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.83,0:25:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些野蠻人到底是哪兒來的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 快回去尋找歸路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.10,0:26:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 不好了 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.85,0:26:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬間跳躍航行裝置出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.33,0:26:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是剛才的離子風暴的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.35,0:26:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.41,0:26:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,測量一下附近可以著陸的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴見星系 S56
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個未知的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.47,0:26:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就在那裡修理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.45,0:26:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.95,0:26:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球真美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.81,0:26:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多綠色植物就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 準備降落
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 調查一下大氣狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.85,0:26:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.45,0:27:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氯氣占95％ 一滴水也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.57,0:27:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多土塊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.99,0:27:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某個星球著陸了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪兒的星球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪兒都好 把門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪兒都好 把門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.97,0:27:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪兒都好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你有帶來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『隨意門』
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都完全忘了有這樣的法寶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.19,0:27:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 大家想回哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.52,0:27:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的 我的家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去空地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.64,0:27:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.92,0:27:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得來到真正的宇宙 不冒一下險就回去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.47,0:28:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒險已經足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.07,0:28:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.38,0:28:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 大雄說的對
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.90,0:28:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就結束的話太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.35,0:28:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 看看這個星球再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.89,0:28:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不想再讓大家犯險了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.19,0:28:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個萬一的話馬上用『隨意門』回去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.29,0:28:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就一會兒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 修理狀況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.21,0:28:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 完全損壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.55,0:28:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬間跳躍航行裝置用不了的話 回去太耗時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.44,0:28:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要花點時間才能修理好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.13,0:28:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 這次的調查太多問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.54,0:28:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛出發通信機就壞了 無法傳送資料
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.29,0:29:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又被奇怪的入侵者闖進
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.59,0:29:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛船還故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.10,0:29:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是因為我丟了神樹之果
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.80,0:29:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神樹之果丟了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.87,0:29:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼重要的東西到底在哪兒丟失的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.07,0:29:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大概在MS3那個星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.18,0:29:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.64,0:29:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 那個星球真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.16,0:29:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要岔開話題
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.59,0:29:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,植物跟泥土都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳來看看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就叫自然美
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.97,0:29:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到這個 心情就不由變得平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.64,0:29:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安看到植物就會變得兩眼放光呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.20,0:29:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳來看看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是植物葉子的細胞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.26,0:29:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 動了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有生命的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 跟我們的人造樹木完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.41,0:30:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽一直說 想生活在自然的花草樹木的星球居住
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊 我們一定能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『吃空間蟲』
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.00,0:30:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃掉超空間 製造出逃生通道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.26,0:30:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青蟲型機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全起見 給你們都噴上『宇宙霜』
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.42,0:30:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蟲蟲 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.73,0:30:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 做好覺悟了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.73,0:30:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 開始宇宙探險了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.75,0:30:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的事啊 我要是能辦到該多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.11,0:30:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的夢 這樣的夢 有好多好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.64,0:30:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UFO在那裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.80,0:30:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然時間不長 謝謝你們照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.45,0:30:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要在這顆星球探險了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.62,0:31:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在口袋之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.26,0:31:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空好遼闊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.95,0:31:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在口袋之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓人興奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.78,0:31:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪獸什麼的 出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.40,0:31:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的出現的話該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.99,0:31:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候 就拜託哆啦A夢了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.38,0:31:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.27,0:31:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 先回去UFO裡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.43,0:31:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.44,0:31:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超空間被扭曲了 危險
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.31,0:31:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金屬身體的蛛蛛...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.45,0:31:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.42,0:31:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.71,0:31:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快拿武器出來
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.53,0:31:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帶著的武器都對付不了它的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.91,0:32:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 『隨意門』...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.99,0:32:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 在哪...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.46,0:32:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.75,0:32:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『隨意門』
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.46,0:32:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去大雄的房間  快快
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.51,0:32:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.10,0:32:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.09,0:32:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.69,0:32:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.41,0:32:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危險
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.99,0:32:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕的蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.07,0:32:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能噴出金屬蜘蛛絲 還有能溶解金屬的毒液
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.30,0:32:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼『隨意門』用不了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.65,0:33:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕我們到了 連『隨意門』都去不到的遙遠地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.43,0:33:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們該怎麼回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.41,0:33:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然要靠他們用UFO載我們回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.80,0:33:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 金屬蜘蛛會襲擊UFO的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.77,0:33:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.35,0:33:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 這樣下去的話UFO會被溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.17,0:33:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快做點什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.42,0:33:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 有個好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.41,0:33:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『吹走的喇叭』
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.75,0:33:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要一吹這個喇叭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.14,0:33:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都會跟隨著喇叭聲出發再也回不來了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.86,0:33:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事後再說明好了 快快
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.72,0:33:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:33:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像沒什麼變化
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是聲音太小 聼不到？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.16,0:34:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 給我『放大燈』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.94,0:34:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.51,0:34:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大燈』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.83,0:34:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 絕對能聼到的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.87,0:34:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.73,0:34:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 靠近點吹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.55,0:34:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 看天上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 那些人什麼時候出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且沒穿宇宙服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.78,0:34:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不能掉以輕心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 吹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.74,0:34:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.38,0:34:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看 它們逃到山上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.53,0:35:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 它們不會再回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.59,0:35:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好宏亮的聲音 不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.94,0:35:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們趕走的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.72,0:35:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物質轉換機』
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.52,0:35:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個將蜘蛛絲換成毛線
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.59,0:35:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毛線？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.54,0:35:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 看著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.08,0:35:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.95,0:35:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.25,0:35:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變成毛線了 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以做圍巾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.08,0:35:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思議的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們看來不是壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.03,0:36:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 我覺得有點不安
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒 只是這麼覺得而已
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位救了我們 非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.80,0:36:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新邀請你們上來
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.94,0:36:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 這樣就有辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.67,0:36:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是說他們在這裡面？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.79,0:36:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 都是因為隨便撿破爛兒才會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.56,0:36:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是破爛兒 也是很好的調查材料
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.65,0:36:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是什麼破爛兒不破爛兒 這是我的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.79,0:36:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這個 快送我們回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.19,0:36:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們不明不白的被你們帶來了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.07,0:36:49.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可傷腦筋 因為瞬間跳躍航行裝置故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.83,0:36:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用那個的話不能回地球嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.56,0:36:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是說不能回去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:37:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概要一億八百萬年
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.69,0:37:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一億年.....
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.25,0:37:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.71,0:37:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是『時光布』跟『救命艇』都沒有了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.82,0:37:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.76,0:37:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.71,0:37:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個回去的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是帶他們去銀河漂流船隊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.02,0:37:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀河漂流船隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.96,0:37:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我們要回去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.45,0:37:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不像你們那樣有個安居的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.94,0:37:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 把記錄放映出來
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.74,0:37:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年前 我們的祖先捨棄了星球
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.09,0:37:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捨棄星球？  為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.87,0:37:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不能再居住了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.23,0:37:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為物質文明過於發達 環境不斷被破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.51,0:37:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然 大氣被破壞 植物枯竭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.15,0:37:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後來變成一個出門都要帶上呼吸裝置的死亡之星
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.79,0:38:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年以來
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.50,0:38:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找尋一個綠色的理想星球
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.26,0:38:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一直在無邊的宇宙漂流
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.49,0:38:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期間會遇到同樣失去星球的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.64,0:38:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起組成銀河漂流船隊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是在宇宙船上出生的新一代
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.98,0:39:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了找尋可以讓我們居住的母星 而組成了調查團
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.79,0:39:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是宇宙少年騎士團
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.91,0:39:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.73,0:39:08.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們四人在太陽系上找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了一個非常美麗的MS3－叫做地球的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.09,0:39:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說找到... 可地球是我們的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.35,0:39:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會讓給你們
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.84,0:39:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 我們沒打算侵略
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.25,0:39:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是希望通過談判 達到和平移居地球的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.06,0:39:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是自古流傳下來的教導
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.38,0:39:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來先回船隊修理好船 就馬上送你們回去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.95,0:39:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.71,0:39:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.54,0:39:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.46,0:39:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.53,0:39:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,資料機器人 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.07,0:39:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.42,0:39:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫李安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.72,0:39:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,源靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.50,0:39:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫菲莉亞 多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.24,0:39:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.77,0:39:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字是？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.34,0:39:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什麼 放我下來 放我下來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.11,0:39:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎是這樣對人表示友好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發要花些時間
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.07,0:40:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉就讓你們這裡稍事休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.79,0:40:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.11,0:40:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好我們也很累了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.36,0:40:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 地球上出發時已經是夜裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.14,0:40:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 我想這裡沒有可以洗澡的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.37,0:40:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.65,0:40:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 沒有熱水出來
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.89,0:40:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 因為除了我就沒什麼人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.95,0:40:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微要用點技巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.87,0:40:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.71,0:40:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在裡面可以呼吸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.46,0:40:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.59,0:40:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.42,0:41:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都叫李安每天洗的 他就是不聼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.85,0:41:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳跟李安真的很要好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.28,0:41:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是朋友而已
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.45,0:41:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.88,0:41:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能讓李安得到幸福的話 我什麼都會做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.14,0:41:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 MS3-地球的資料傳來了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.61,0:41:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓隻老鼠混進那裡果然沒白費
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.49,0:42:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球果然是個理想的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.86,0:42:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是踏破鐵鞋無覓處
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.86,0:42:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 在這之前還有一些問題
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.16,0:42:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.81,0:42:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 工程還差多少
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.44,0:42:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差些許而已
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.40,0:42:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何 結果一定能讓你滿意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.01,0:42:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我期待著 摩亞
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.81,0:42:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聼著 我忠實的僕人們
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.01,0:42:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了得到我們的星球 要盡快完成
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.11,0:43:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然說要幫忙修理 可是我還很睏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.27,0:43:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機器人也會睏的嗎 真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.46,0:43:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請把那片電路板更換一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.80,0:43:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果『時光布』在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.92,0:43:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的機器人擁有的道具真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.40,0:43:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是從未來來的機器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.00,0:43:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說 現在...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.42,0:43:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 住手 現在是重要的時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.04,0:43:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吃我 我不好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.96,0:43:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個 這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.41,0:43:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『萬能韁繩』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.02,0:43:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來 過來
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.03,0:43:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.30,0:43:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢要被吃掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.83,0:43:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.46,0:43:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.47,0:43:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很溫馴 大家也來坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.08,0:44:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 不要嚇人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.19,0:44:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.06,0:44:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安也來坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.68,0:44:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 坐上去舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.58,0:44:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.49,0:44:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們擁有的力量真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.61,0:44:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是托哆啦A夢的福
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.41,0:44:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真神奇 有些什麼機關的？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.66,0:44:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手被纏住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.84,0:44:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安有危險
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.43,0:44:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.96,0:44:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.76,0:44:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.71,0:44:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懸崖...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.57,0:44:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是危險
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.39,0:45:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你救了我 大雄真勇敢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.09,0:45:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人這麼說還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.69,0:45:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.71,0:45:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.68,0:45:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.39,0:45:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.47,0:45:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.70,0:45:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發準備OK
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.31,0:45:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 出發咯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.11,0:45:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不好 毛線還沒清理
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.09,0:45:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊 這不影響出發
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.24,0:45:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.73,0:45:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於可以去船隊了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.31,0:46:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 因為沒有用瞬間跳躍航行裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.98,0:46:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途中得找個星球停下來 讓引擎休息
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.29,0:46:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去船隊要花些時間
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.62,0:46:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 還要這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.63,0:46:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 這總比要花一億年要好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.74,0:46:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.23,0:46:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到星球的話再通知你們
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.07,0:46:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這之前先休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.36,0:46:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼決定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.06,0:46:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這麼多星球 卻不能讓生物居住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.77,0:46:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船隊的人都已經找了三百年
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.51,0:46:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是讓自己的星球變得不堪的祖先的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.45,0:46:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.24,0:46:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能 這裡可是UFO裡面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:46:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.31,0:46:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.04,0:47:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是引擎故障的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.84,0:47:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.53,0:47:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 偏離軌道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.13,0:47:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被什麼拉住了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.95,0:47:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 快去調查原因
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.15,0:47:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.84,0:47:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.29,0:47:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.36,0:47:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一光年前面 有個黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑洞？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.11,0:47:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 引擎開到最大
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.56,0:47:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到正常航道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.66,0:47:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.83,0:47:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.36,0:47:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才真危險 如果再近一點的話
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.23,0:47:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會被吸進去 再也出不來了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.67,0:48:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.17,0:48:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盡快 找尋可以著陸的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.17,0:48:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為引擎有些負荷過重了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.03,0:48:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還真想看看那個黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.89,0:48:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼 真到了能看到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會被吸進去 再也回不來了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.87,0:48:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周圍的星球也好 什麼東西都會被吸進去的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.48,0:48:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.08,0:48:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才是什麼聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.74,0:48:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我肚子餓得像黑洞一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.52,0:48:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.11,0:48:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒找到可以著陸的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 航道有點偏離 不過找到一個
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.06,0:48:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考慮能源狀況 還是快點著陸比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.65,0:48:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就在那裡著陸
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.27,0:49:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真大的霧啊 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 雷達...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.21,0:49:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.32,0:49:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.54,0:49:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.77,0:49:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某個星球著陸了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.64,0:49:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板開著
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.68,0:49:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安他們先下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.21,0:49:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也出去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.58,0:50:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的霧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.14,0:50:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個氣味是？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.68,0:50:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟後山的樹一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.80,0:50:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.22,0:50:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.72,0:50:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是霧散了是地球的話
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 這種玩笑不要開啦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.52,0:50:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霧散了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.16,0:50:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.93,0:50:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,錯不了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.73,0:50:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是後山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.87,0:50:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.90,0:50:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.50,0:50:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 待會見
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.51,0:50:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 我玩的很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.78,0:50:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.68,0:50:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安他們應該早和我們說嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.42,0:50:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是想給我們驚喜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.12,0:50:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.23,0:50:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這是之前的測驗卷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.76,0:50:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,測驗卷？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.02,0:50:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1...100分？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.05,0:50:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是給你的獎勵 努力學習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.14,0:51:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 謝謝老師
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.90,0:51:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.61,0:51:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是夢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.61,0:51:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要用『夢境確定機』嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.06,0:51:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.17,0:51:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點給媽媽看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.57,0:51:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.96,0:51:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.37,0:51:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好幾天沒回去 媽媽一定會大發雷霆的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.39,0:51:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.73,0:51:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.43,0:51:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很擔心你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.71,0:51:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你回來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.48,0:51:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天好好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.99,0:51:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,餓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.90,0:51:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 給你的銅鑼燒
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.91,0:51:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.72,0:51:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.96,0:51:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.14,0:51:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 完全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.37,0:51:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開地球之前撿到的石頭
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.12,0:51:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.28,0:51:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.37,0:51:51.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆 哆 哆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.46,0:51:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.50,0:51:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.96,0:51:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多吃一點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.50,0:51:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.53,0:52:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.68,0:52:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.75,0:52:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.18,0:52:12.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 這裡不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.94,0:52:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼 這不是平時玩耍的空地嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.07,0:52:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我清醒過來 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.66,0:52:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.75,0:52:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被幻覺迷惑了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.20,0:52:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.71,0:52:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.33,0:52:28.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 快喚醒大家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.97,0:52:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我找 我找
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.97,0:52:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『喚醒遠處的人鬧鐘』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.21,0:52:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我暈過去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.52,0:52:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.41,0:52:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄他們 洛古 吾郎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.93,0:53:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板關上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.20,0:53:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 快把甲板打開
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.91,0:53:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快打開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.19,0:53:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.82,0:53:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開 快開
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.81,0:53:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 為什麼開不了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.74,0:53:15.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 好像故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.41,0:53:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.29,0:53:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快開 快打開
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.20,0:53:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 給我開
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.60,0:53:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 快進來
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.63,0:53:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.86,0:53:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.10,0:53:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.68,0:53:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.03,0:53:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.52,0:53:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.81,0:53:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.88,0:53:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.11,0:53:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快進去裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.17,0:53:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.13,0:53:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.22,0:54:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻覺之星？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.18,0:54:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們太想回地球了 所以才會被騙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.27,0:54:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是幻覺...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.18,0:54:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻覺也好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.49,0:54:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經受不了一直在宇宙了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.84,0:54:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.24,0:54:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.74,0:54:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前 好想在媽媽還活著的時候 找到合適的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.97,0:54:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現在 為了銀河漂流船隊的所有人 我要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.61,0:54:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到船隊的軌道了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.02,0:54:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 菲莉亞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.28,0:54:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在隔壁的雷達室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.16,0:54:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.96,0:54:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.78,0:55:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.69,0:55:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛是妳救了我的吧 我是來跟妳道謝的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.31,0:55:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用謝
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.08,0:55:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.37,0:55:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.34,0:55:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就能回去的 不用花一億年
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.06,0:55:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.61,0:55:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.50,0:55:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.77,0:55:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次又怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.20,0:55:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有事情發生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.10,0:55:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.35,0:55:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛船偏離了航路
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.69,0:55:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是操作錯誤了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.60,0:55:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真失禮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.19,0:55:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛船不動了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.94,0:55:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.63,0:55:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.85,0:55:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像宇宙船的墳場
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.75,0:55:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太淒慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.74,0:56:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源急速下降 這是礦石生命體
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.23,0:56:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們在吃飛船的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.83,0:56:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快被擠壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.45,0:56:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 周圍的宇宙船就是被它們弄報廢的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.61,0:56:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎停止
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.61,0:56:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源開始見底了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.50,0:56:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.89,0:56:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.50,0:56:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是找到了新的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.43,0:56:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.65,0:56:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是飛彈
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.93,0:56:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛彈？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.34,0:56:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.49,0:56:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在快逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.55,0:56:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 沒能源了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.76,0:57:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飛彈是哪兒來的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.87,0:57:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 我們帶你們離開
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.32,0:57:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.98,0:57:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飛船是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.25,0:57:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要帶我們去哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.81,0:57:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安份點跟來就是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.51,0:57:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的飛船都沒生命反應
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.07,0:57:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼人在操縱著那些飛船
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.80,0:57:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去船隊的話 就回不了地球對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.05,0:57:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.19,0:57:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在只能靜觀其變
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.46,0:57:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個惑星是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.26,0:57:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 這裡到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.33,0:58:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很宏偉的要塞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於回來了 李安
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.48,0:58:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是被選中的騎士們
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.93,0:58:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於找到了個理想的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.43,0:58:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.29,0:58:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你在這裡 這裡是哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.74,0:58:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是獨立軍的前線基地
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.06,0:58:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,獨立軍？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.80,0:58:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了銀河漂流船隊的市民們
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.38,0:58:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要得到可以居住的母星 而組成的崇高部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是何時成立的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.87,0:58:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們出去調查之後 司令官成立的獨立軍
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.39,0:58:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了教導嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.68,0:59:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不論什麼情況 都不能採用任何侵略手段
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.31,0:59:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說教導 不要笑話了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.19,0:59:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年不斷的彷徨
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.96,0:59:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是已經終於找到了理想星球－地球了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.01,0:59:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.12,0:59:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是潛入你們裡面的老鼠報告的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.53,0:59:18.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠 哪兒 在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.46,0:59:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠是指間諜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.09,0:59:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦妳了 菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.10,0:59:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是真的吧 菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.31,0:59:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 通信器不是壞了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.62,0:59:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 是我弄壞的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.81,0:59:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.38,0:59:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不想讓你知道獨立軍的行動
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.36,0:59:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我知道你是不會協助的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.03,0:59:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.81,0:59:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道甲板打不開的時候也是妳...？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.14,0:59:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.35,0:59:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.45,0:59:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們擁有神奇的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.55,1:00:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了李安不被地球人所妨礙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.98,1:00:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.25,1:00:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 妳救了我...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.09,1:00:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誘導我們去宇宙船的墓場 把我們帶來這裡也是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.31,1:00:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 這樣才更...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.10,1:00:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.21,1:00:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這全是為了你...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.15,1:00:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.81,1:00:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.57,1:00:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.10,1:00:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球 是地球人的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.45,1:00:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你考慮清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.69,1:00:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還那麼說嗎 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.03,1:00:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶這些人去監牢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.10,1:00:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.06,1:00:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.84,1:00:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 請你考慮清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.39,1:00:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.33,1:00:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 過來這裡
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.09,1:00:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 請你考慮清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.60,1:00:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.83,1:01:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫他爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.14,1:01:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個司令官是？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.55,1:01:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特司令官是李安的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.59,1:01:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請大家原諒
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.48,1:01:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是李安的錯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.53,1:01:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自從那個叫摩亞的人來了之後
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.80,1:01:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸跟大家都變了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.38,1:01:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞是誰
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.66,1:01:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官旁邊的人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.35,1:01:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古魯·摩亞
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.43,1:01:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古魯·摩亞
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.63,1:01:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs23}諾查丹瑪斯：法國醫師、占星術師
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.63,1:01:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾查丹瑪斯的預言裡提到 毀滅地球的大魔王的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.87,1:01:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 哆啦A夢是從22世紀來的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.42,1:01:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 未來是有可能改變的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.38,1:01:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管如何 這樣下去的話地球很危險
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.63,1:01:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得從這裡逃脫 回去船隊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.77,1:01:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.54,1:01:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『潛地艇』
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.02,1:01:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是潛水艇嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.81,1:02:02.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個可以潛入地下 是『潛地艇』
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.46,1:02:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被發現就糟糕了 快點
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.39,1:02:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.60,1:02:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 飛船的能源能不能到達母船
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.46,1:02:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該能 如果是逃到母船附近的軌道的話
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.14,1:02:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用應急燃料可以去到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.38,1:02:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.31,1:02:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.78,1:02:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.20,1:02:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.43,1:03:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.60,1:03:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.30,1:03:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 一起走吧 快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.93,1:03:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.78,1:03:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.75,1:03:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古的操控真好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.37,1:03:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡 都比不上李安啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.01,1:03:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.49,1:03:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介紹一個新同伴給大家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新同伴？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.72,1:03:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.43,1:03:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.70,1:04:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 我就知道妳一定是站在我們這邊的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.27,1:04:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎新同伴吧 好嗎 吾郎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.70,1:04:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 菲莉亞 拜託妳聯絡船隊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.51,1:04:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.42,1:04:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 軌道怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.76,1:04:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.93,1:04:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 逃脫了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.99,1:04:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都吩咐這麼多次看好他們的了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.57,1:04:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.99,1:04:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 他們用了神奇的道具才...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.52,1:04:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特 讓地球人去了船隊便麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.23,1:04:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快去抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.41,1:04:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.09,1:04:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.28,1:04:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞這賤人 居然背叛我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.71,1:05:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 後面有些什麼在追著
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.76,1:05:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是無人艦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 開大能源逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.69,1:05:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊 燃料用盡了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.00,1:05:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 還沒聯絡上船隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.45,1:05:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該在附近了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.64,1:05:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是獨立軍捕獲船
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.96,1:05:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼辛苦才逃出來的說...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.54,1:05:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要被抓回去嗎...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.54,1:05:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像逃脫了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.21,1:05:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這道光是？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.87,1:05:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.22,1:05:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.97,1:05:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是船隊救了我們
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.95,1:05:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.93,1:05:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是母船啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.43,1:05:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.52,1:05:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.58,1:07:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MSK少年騎士團 辛苦你們了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.26,1:07:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請馬上去協議會
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.01,1:07:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎MS3地球人 我們歡迎你們的到來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.89,1:07:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像知道我們的樣子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.27,1:07:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告訴了他們大體的情況了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.75,1:07:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你們跟我一起 去協議會報告一直以來的情況
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.57,1:07:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 這都是為了地球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.02,1:07:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕摩亞的戰略是 打算侵略地球之前 用武力支配母船
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.54,1:07:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸竟然會發動戰爭 簡直難以相信
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.63,1:07:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古魯·摩亞到底是何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.73,1:07:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.15,1:07:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好強大
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.61,1:07:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙船裡面居然有這樣的大都市
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.35,1:07:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少人口
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.80,1:07:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大約一千萬人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.21,1:07:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是拉古娜星人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.06,1:08:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年間 像吾郎這樣 從其他星球來的住民也很多
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.90,1:08:05.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是協議會的聯邦大廈
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.78,1:08:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到銀河漂流船隊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.55,1:08:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諸位就是勇敢的地球少年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.33,1:08:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是協議會議長摩滋拉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.45,1:08:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 馬上開始匯報吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.40,1:08:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.34,1:08:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的諸位也拜託了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.96,1:08:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.88,1:08:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,獨立軍打算用武力支配船隊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.26,1:08:38.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還打算侵略他們的星球－地球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.35,1:08:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特司令官怎麼會做這種事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.14,1:08:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自從摩亞來了之後 他就變得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.91,1:08:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有逃跑了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.50,1:08:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要捨棄船隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.09,1:08:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這時候得戰鬥才行了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.62,1:08:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我們不懂如何戰鬥啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.47,1:08:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 現在不是說這話的時候
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.97,1:09:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年歷史以來 我們還沒打過一場仗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕 將來也不會打破這個教導的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.10,1:09:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 我們已經沒時間考慮了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.59,1:09:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們該怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.38,1:09:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去聖域請求神的教導吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.58,1:09:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說的神是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.89,1:09:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還說去聖域來著
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.96,1:09:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聖域是這艘船裡 唯一有自然生態的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.59,1:09:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神就在那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.02,1:09:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的指導者 也是我們的生命之源
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.82,1:09:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底他是怎樣的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.18,1:09:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並非是人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.48,1:09:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我們的神 尤古道之樹
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.51,1:10:08.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年前 我們的祖先離開惑星拉古娜的時候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.42,1:10:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個少年 在瓦礫之間的一塊土地上 發現一顆發光的樹苗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.52,1:10:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很小心地帶回船上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.47,1:10:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後 大家很小心地照料這顆樹苗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.65,1:10:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從此以來 我們從尤古道之樹上學會很多知識
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.19,1:10:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在她作為我們的神 存在於我們的心中
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.43,1:10:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲傷 辛苦 迷惘的時候 就會撫摸這個果實聼從教導
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.01,1:10:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個形狀...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.34,1:10:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟這個一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.66,1:10:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神樹之果 這個在哪兒撿到的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.04,1:10:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們從地球出發的時候丟的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.32,1:10:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這顆樹的果實啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.62,1:11:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這顆果實 是尤古道之樹給少年騎士團的信物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.72,1:11:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使離開船隊 也會保護我們
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.49,1:11:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是護身符一樣的東西呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.27,1:11:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 在幻覺之星讓我清醒過來的 是這個護身符啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.87,1:11:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 還給你 不要再丟失了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.60,1:11:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 李安 請求尤古道之樹的教導吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.87,1:11:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.16,1:11:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.69,1:11:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.04,1:11:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇跡 已經過世的李安的媽媽...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.32,1:11:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安的媽媽已經死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.54,1:11:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在李安還小的時候...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.26,1:11:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 爸爸他...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.43,1:11:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.01,1:12:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.39,1:12:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做的事只有一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.01,1:12:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要打倒摩亞
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.56,1:12:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒摩亞？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.07,1:12:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把控制爸爸的摩亞打倒
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.54,1:12:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞用超能力控制人心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.02,1:12:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他操縱了船隊的幾個人 成立了獨立軍
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.53,1:12:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒摩亞 獨立軍就會瓦解
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.20,1:12:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都會變回和平
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.06,1:12:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擁有這種力量的摩亞 我們能對付得了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.23,1:12:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊 看看周圍
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.09,1:12:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是有愛你 信任你...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.46,1:12:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...能夠依靠的 新的同伴嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.08,1:12:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟神樹之果一起 永遠守護著你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.49,1:12:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 不要迷惘 勇敢前進
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.08,1:12:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.80,1:12:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要迷惘 勇敢前進
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.77,1:13:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.54,1:13:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人和蓋亞號的人合流了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.64,1:13:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得趕快讓司令官下決定
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.02,1:13:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特 你在猶豫什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.36,1:13:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴多列布軍團出擊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.77,1:13:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向蓋亞號發動總攻擊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.95,1:13:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大量獨立軍的戰鬥機 正在向這邊趕來了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.79,1:13:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.34,1:13:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.13,1:13:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.65,1:13:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去打倒摩亞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.38,1:13:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.20,1:13:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 我一定會將和平帶回來的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.04,1:13:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428.037,435)\fs24}宇宙少年騎士團全體出擊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.06,1:14:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428.037,435)\fs24}重複 宇宙少年騎士團全體出擊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.56,1:14:01.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 加油
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.72,1:14:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.41,1:14:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.55,1:14:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 燃料怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.42,1:14:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常充足
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.47,1:14:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎 加油哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.94,1:14:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我們也出擊吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.65,1:14:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 一定要保護好地球
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.21,1:14:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.64,1:14:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.70,1:14:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.70,1:14:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們用遊戲裡面的宇宙船戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.19,1:14:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.34,1:14:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 出發吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.56,1:14:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.22,1:14:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳要保護好李安哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.33,1:14:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.74,1:14:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打開遊戲 出去外面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.42,1:15:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 聼到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聼到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.46,1:15:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聼好了 這不是遊戲
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.58,1:15:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.13,1:15:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了保護地球
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.84,1:15:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.16,1:15:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.11,1:15:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷達損壞 撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.79,1:15:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打中了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.19,1:15:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被擊中了 緊急脫出
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.49,1:15:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要輸給大雄了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.48,1:15:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被擊中了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.86,1:16:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不會輸的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.77,1:16:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.45,1:16:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 不如將基地的控制塔破壞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.12,1:16:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 大雄 幫幫忙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.98,1:16:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.05,1:16:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前居然沒想到...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.21,1:16:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 小夫 胖虎 麻煩你們援助射擊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.99,1:16:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 交給我們
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.66,1:16:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那個
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.36,1:16:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然噴了『宇宙霜』
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.60,1:16:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過因為重力很小 要小心點
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.36,1:16:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.16,1:17:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近處看真大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.47,1:17:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來很難破壞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.49,1:17:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 用這個
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.21,1:17:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『黏土粉』
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.45,1:17:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒上這個 不管什麼東西 都會變得像粘土那樣軟綿綿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.58,1:17:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.44,1:17:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 搓圓吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.64,1:17:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣控制塔就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.46,1:17:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 敵人的飛船都不動了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.64,1:17:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他們成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.08,1:17:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是他們
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.93,1:17:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 控制桿被破壞了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.94,1:17:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修復不能 攻擊艇全滅
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.90,1:17:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是那幫地球人搞得鬼嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.41,1:17:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 我們只有潛入蓋亞號
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.93,1:17:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佔領控制室
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.64,1:17:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.10,1:17:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.55,1:17:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不像
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.19,1:18:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.31,1:18:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.52,1:18:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還還還 還好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.15,1:18:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.88,1:18:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.66,1:18:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.33,1:18:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 摩亞打算將這個要塞開進蓋亞號
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.80,1:18:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 他就在這裡咯？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.85,1:18:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.95,1:18:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們進去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.34,1:18:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.13,1:18:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我們走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.34,1:18:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.05,1:18:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快進去裡面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.57,1:19:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令室好像是在這邊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.43,1:19:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.49,1:19:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也進去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.03,1:19:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 洛古 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.00,1:19:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.47,1:19:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本無法接近啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.35,1:19:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 你們根本不是對手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.94,1:19:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離接觸還有1分鐘
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.73,1:19:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.01,1:19:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用蓋亞號的權限控制全市
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.54,1:19:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,支配那些市民的時候到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.50,1:19:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不會得逞的 摩亞
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.82,1:19:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.97,1:19:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.15,1:19:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你是被摩亞的超能力控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.32,1:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 300年來 蓋亞號的市民
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.80,1:19:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多麼希望找到母星-地球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在跟市民一起 拿起武器戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.15,1:19:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.41,1:19:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 過來這裡
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.30,1:20:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.29,1:20:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.32,1:20:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷 UFO接近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.34,1:20:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在往控制室方向航行中
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.30,1:20:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推測30秒前
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.94,1:20:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 連你也...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.66,1:20:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神樹之果
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.14,1:20:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特 快殺了他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.34,1:20:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.90,1:20:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開槍
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.20,1:20:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.67,1:20:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始與蓋亞號銜接
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.19,1:20:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銜接完成
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.49,1:20:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特 快開槍
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.10,1:20:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特 你這個混蛋...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.20,1:21:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞 覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.06,1:21:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.81,1:21:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.84,1:21:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.44,1:21:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.74,1:21:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.65,1:21:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞的超能力 敵不過李安爸爸心中的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.82,1:21:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 真對不起 請原諒爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.29,1:21:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.64,1:21:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.92,1:21:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.78,1:21:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李貝爾特司令官 我們到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.12,1:21:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都被它控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.31,1:21:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.95,1:21:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.84,1:21:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.53,1:21:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友們 都還好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.28,1:22:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.49,1:22:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被李安打敗了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.33,1:22:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.19,1:22:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.59,1:22:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球得救了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.86,1:22:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.58,1:22:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.79,1:22:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.31,1:22:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.02,1:22:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聼李安說了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.07,1:22:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦醬 真的很感謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.94,1:22:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦醬...  我叫哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.93,1:22:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們什麼也沒做 是李安的勇氣獲得了勝利
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.52,1:22:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 摩亞到底是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.38,1:22:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.90,1:22:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機 機器人來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.62,1:22:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,構造很簡單的機器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.38,1:22:35.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像蛻下來的空殼一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.14,1:22:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙居然擁有超能力 太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.18,1:22:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.18,1:22:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓋亞號的軌道 向要塞的惑星前進了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.31,1:22:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法控制
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.90,1:22:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是銜接的時候出現了故障
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.78,1:22:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊與蓋亞號聯繫
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.59,1:22:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去會跟惑星相撞的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.93,1:22:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想想辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.68,1:23:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你這麼說...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.47,1:23:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法躲開嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.62,1:23:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.62,1:23:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 試試看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.32,1:23:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.30,1:23:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它對"相對靜止"的行星起不了作用
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.49,1:23:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是對"相對運動"著的蓋亞號用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.63,1:23:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.95,1:23:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』太小了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.03,1:23:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『放大燈』放大
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.33,1:23:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.44,1:23:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支『放大燈』 威力不夠
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.90,1:23:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『複製鏡』大量複製
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.86,1:23:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 真聰明啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.58,1:23:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 按照計劃
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.78,1:23:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大燈』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.35,1:23:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.71,1:23:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說明了 快點
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.06,1:23:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.20,1:23:59.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全束手無策
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.58,1:24:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 拿好『放大燈』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.10,1:24:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等收到信號 就一起照射『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.96,1:24:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,團隊合作很重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.26,1:24:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.16,1:24:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 這樣下去的話...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.37,1:24:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們三百年的歷史就到此為止了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.52,1:24:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.67,1:24:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.89,1:24:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.56,1:24:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.38,1:24:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大燈』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.66,1:24:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.16,1:25:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 軌道修正了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.80,1:25:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奇跡
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.18,1:25:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上進行修復工作
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.86,1:25:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.73,1:25:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.24,1:25:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.03,1:25:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.43,1:25:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制得怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.02,1:25:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.06,1:25:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凱旋回歸
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.94,1:25:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝大家
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.81,1:25:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬間跳躍航行裝置修好了 就送你們回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.10,1:25:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亞 都說了將破爛兒都搬走嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.00,1:25:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不是破爛兒
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.83,1:25:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些都是大家對地球的回憶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.10,1:25:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 很快就要分開了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.87,1:25:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.91,1:25:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是摩亞
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.14,1:26:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體連帶太多東西 出不來啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.87,1:26:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.62,1:26:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『硬硬燈』
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.01,1:26:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你變得硬邦邦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.04,1:26:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是摩亞？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.74,1:26:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那個機器人嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.94,1:26:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 摩亞沒有屬於自己的身體
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.55,1:26:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它進入了機器人裡面
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.42,1:26:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個要怎麼處理
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.21,1:26:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五分鐘後就會回復原狀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.91,1:26:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.06,1:26:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『飛行行李簽-宇宙版』
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.30,1:26:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寫上寄送地址
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.44,1:26:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要寄出去？哪兒？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.08,1:26:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑洞
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.96,1:26:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亞到底是什麼來的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.24,1:27:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是隱藏在大家內心的邪惡凝聚物
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.48,1:27:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諸位 我在此再次宣言
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.28,1:27:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會遵從尤古道之樹的教導
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.61,1:27:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論什麼情況 都不容許用武力去移居某星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.85,1:27:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了能找到可以和平移居的星球 我們會繼續旅程
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.00,1:27:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在宇宙的某處 一定有個可以成為我們故鄉的星球 等著我們
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.75,1:27:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的旅程是走向未來的希望之旅
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.44,1:27:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們一定 要保護好這美麗的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.39,1:28:02.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了不重蹈拉古娜星的悲劇
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.85,1:28:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.65,1:28:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.67,1:28:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.97,1:28:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.55,1:28:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了 李安 多多保重
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.04,1:28:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一定會找到一個美麗的星球的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.20,1:28:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.37,1:28:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.04,1:28:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.64,1:28:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於回到地球了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.42,1:28:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.56,1:28:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.89,1:28:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 待會見
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.41,1:28:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 我玩的很高興
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.56,1:28:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.95,1:28:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是又去了幻覺之星的話
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.10,1:28:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.80,1:28:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.64,1:28:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這是之前的測驗卷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.21,1:28:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,測驗卷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.71,1:28:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0分
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.41,1:28:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 不是幻覺
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.21,1:28:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.11,1:29:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 有什麼好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.26,1:29:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.71,1:29:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 太好了 呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.81,1:29:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...呢
